#N canvas 100 60 1300 800 12;
#X text 20 -30 Analog instrument: pulse (with PWM) \, saw \, a sub (one or two octaves down \, or a narrow pulse) and noise in a mixer \, a smooth 24 dB low-pass \, one ADSR \, an LFO (triangle \, square \, random \, noise) to pitch \, pulse width and filter \, and glide. Settings on <prefix>-<name>.;
